---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /news/
title: News
description: "포스메이게임즈의 새로운 소식과 언론 보도"
---

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">News</p>
    <h1 class="h-xl">소식</h1>
    <p>포스메이게임즈의 새로운 소식과 언론 보도를 전해드립니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:8px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="news-list">
      {% for post in collections.news %}
      {% set href = post.url if post.url else post.data.link %}
      <li class="news-item">
        {% if href %}<a class="row" href="{{ href }}"{% if not post.url %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{% else %}<div class="row is-plain">{% endif %}
          <div class="media ratio-16-9" data-label="News">
            <img src="{{ post.data.image or '/assets/images/news/' + post.fileSlug + '.png' }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="352" height="198">
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="news-meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | dateKR }}</time>
              {% if post.data.source %}<span class="news-source">{{ post.data.source }}</span>{% endif %}
              {% if href and not post.url %}<span class="muted">↗</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
            <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
            {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p class="news-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
        {% if href %}</a>{% else %}</div>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
